    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτόνομ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>living under one's own
				laws, independent,</i> of persons and states, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.140
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				15
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, etc.; freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. ἐπὶ σφῶν αὐτῶν οἰκεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφιέναι αὐ. τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.139
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. ποιεῖν τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.1.36
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lac.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις . . ἐλευθέρα καὶ αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.481
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. πολιτεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>of one's own free will,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ αὐ. . . Ἀΐδην καταβήσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					821
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of
			animals, <i>feeding and ranging at will,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.8
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.).</div>
